    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aReborn the Soul\u300b&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Is\u00a0a\u00a0mental\u00a0illness\u00a0themed\u00a0game\u00a0developed\u00a0by\u00a0three\u00a0people\u00a0that\u00a0\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >presents\u00a0the\u00a0symptoms\u00a0of\u00a0mental\u00a0illness\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0form\u00a0of\u00a0a\u00a0game\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player plays as a teenager experiencing the pain of mental illness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstracting the symptoms of mental illness into monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player needs to destroy all the monsters in sight,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New forms can be unlocked after clearing the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can put their favorite equipment in the vault to save.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here are the features of the game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/7d3156cf2fa7054b7ae846f19b2b6c3e.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span>Gain psychological knowledge in combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/321d0a0a4aa4d4c0bb8c52fe419f41a7.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mental knowledge and use it in real life\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/af8ec91c84f46e683eabcdce185b838a.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Feel the pain of mental patients in the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/d2edeeb79e7c853572e4497399f7edb4.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat elite monsters and get extra rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/8ed9aac361e44937bbb3f413ff0f0187.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight two bosses at once until your soul is saved\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/7f3dd25239a9962d7d0344b63e23e5c8.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/4fbad102e7891be7a44d1905e1e8e688.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple skill options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360330/extras/3cc97aae7dcb5f28c733efef098a7933.avif?t=1744697289\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> Collocation of equipment</p>",
